  message: "DONE — PR #545 (selfh/dev 6177668c7b). Chose option (a) reject (over the audit's option (b) document) for consistency with the just-closed cli-input validation umbrella: cmd_search rejects an empty / whitespace-only pattern with rc=2 up front, instead of silently matching every symbol (an empty pattern is a substring of every name). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (live): 'search \"\"' and 'search \"   \"' -> rc=2 'Error: search pattern cannot be empty.'. cli-input standalone (P4). Core 100% coverage."  # bf0b
